 "units": [
  {
   "id": "t_6d902a82a47ab09dbbd0",
   "sourceHash": "6d902a82a47ab09dbbd0e042e17940687753e814f2c44ab6ab6280ef1b2eca71",
   "text": "怀孕后，我一直精力不足、身体酸痛、疲惫不堪。Kairali Ayurvedic Healing Village 的产后健康方案正是我所需要的。治疗非常滋补，让我重新找回了力量。饮食建议和草本补充剂让我的精力明显提升，宁静的环境也让我的康复过程完整而充实。我衷心向每一位希望恢复健康的新手妈妈推荐这个方案。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2c0c0ce4d882e0500ce5",
   "sourceHash": "2c0c0ce4d882e0500ce5fb9a3a05a94e729328b58b4387646e77c22dca45a098",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]Ankita 女士[[CLOSE_1]][[OPEN_2]]★★★★★[[CLOSE_2]][[OPEN_3]]5.0[[CLOSE_3]]",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c3d61f260e614291fe0d",
   "sourceHash": "c3d61f260e614291fe0d77d13d0b2db40bc42534bcd131ea192cc83ae032dbda",
   "text": "顺产或剖腹产后，我何时可以参加？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_cac0cf52286a3031abbe",
   "sourceHash": "cac0cf52286a3031abbec3f1019d3325583440939a18a87b16e391c69761125e",
   "text": "具体时间取决于您的恢复情况和目前接受的护理。请与您的产科医护人员讨论拟定的住院安排，并询问是否适合、哺乳事宜，以及宝宝或陪同人员可能需要的任何支持。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_89a133dc40df8410b4a2",
   "sourceHash": "89a133dc40df8410b4a296e3a5b7c258622f15297469fa590d316b383f3b7c30",
   "text": "我可以带宝宝同来吗？治疗期间是否提供照看服务？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_22f8e3feea840da033c7",
   "sourceHash": "22f8e3feea840da033c74f147d8b4ada7d6ee60d0b94dd2ef2c0ea64d851efb2",
   "text": "可以，您可以带宝宝同来。如有需要，可另行付费安排育儿看护人员。请在入院前说明您的需求，以便确认相关安排和费用。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_408f1e48f233f35ed6a9",
   "sourceHash": "408f1e48f233f35ed6a95cc2e14098af121125fd43074e50b65f8d44c8bf5c66",
   "text": "产后焕活疗法 Sutika Paricharya（产后健康方案）",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Source concatenates two titles without a space ('TherapySutika'); a space was inserted in the translation."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ee0a31ce8c0093485a55",
   "sourceHash": "ee0a31ce8c0093485a55d5741c7ff327d1c88451a6b28c3a1212a28ebe8923b6",
   "text": "面向新手妈妈的阿育吠陀产后健康方案",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_92338560e1fb48fc1faf",
   "sourceHash": "92338560e1fb48fc1faf027bcdb78e34254ed1c46fe8915aed30d31f00cf210a",
   "text": "一位女士在户外抱着年幼的孩子。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4e644e0338af23303f53",
   "sourceHash": "4e644e0338af23303f53b510c485db2140931763d8ac77b18409c21a7141e3d0",
   "text": "一位女士躺在木制治疗床上接受头面部按摩。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a402bd77b3cce5a30c45",
   "sourceHash": "a402bd77b3cce5a30c45f072061e3543bf0962094bb5a361356decdf8692326b",
